WEBVTT

00:23.840 --> 00:28.839
(Based on Softstar Technology
single-player game "Chinese Paladin 3")

00:28.840 --> 00:35.359
(Copyright Notice)

00:35.360 --> 00:36.879
(Viewers under the age of majority
should watch with guardian permission.)

00:36.880 --> 00:38.689
(The content depicted in this film
is fictional.)

00:38.690 --> 00:40.520
(Do not imitate in real life.)

00:58.820 --> 01:01.789
♪Blades of wind cut through dark clouds,
sunset flares to life♪

01:01.790 --> 01:04.060
♪Staining the vast sky red♪

01:04.550 --> 01:09.720
♪A fierce spirit forges a sacred sword,
unafraid of demons♪

01:10.300 --> 01:13.089
♪Breaking the heavens,
shattering the shrouded dark♪

01:13.090 --> 01:15.959
♪Breaking the dream,
thorns blinding the way♪

01:15.960 --> 01:18.379
♪Breaking love,
trapped in hatred and obsession♪

01:18.380 --> 01:21.129
♪The sword's edge ignites
with burning blood♪

01:21.130 --> 01:24.109
♪Fight to the fullest♪

01:24.110 --> 01:26.899
♪Burn to the fullest♪

01:26.900 --> 01:29.689
♪For the one I love♪

01:29.690 --> 01:32.439
♪No regrets whether laughter or tears♪

01:32.440 --> 01:35.239
♪I never stop searching♪

01:35.240 --> 01:38.460
♪I never stop falling♪

01:41.020 --> 01:44.130
♪A furious roar shakes the earth
and pierces the sky♪

01:53.760 --> 01:56.799
=Sword and Fairy 3=

01:56.800 --> 01:59.040
=Episode 8=
=The Power of the Earth Spirit=

02:05.460 --> 02:06.780
This is it.

02:19.220 --> 02:20.419
Help!

02:20.420 --> 02:22.180
- Jing Tian, help me!
- Xuejian!

02:25.740 --> 02:27.260
Save me, quickly!

02:32.620 --> 02:35.100
Something is wrong.
Everyone, get out of here!

02:41.980 --> 02:44.500
These vines are far more powerful
than Wan Yuzhi's.

02:54.620 --> 02:56.990
You... You all, look!

03:16.380 --> 03:17.419
It...

03:17.420 --> 03:18.979
It is the Vine Old Monster.

03:18.980 --> 03:22.099
(Ancient Vine Spirit)

03:22.100 --> 03:25.539
Humans, what gives you the nerve

03:25.540 --> 03:28.660
to set foot in my forest?

03:30.540 --> 03:31.859
This is a misunderstanding.

03:31.860 --> 03:32.739
We came here

03:32.740 --> 03:35.100
hoping to help you.

03:36.550 --> 03:38.059
Help me?

03:38.060 --> 03:39.100
First,

03:39.140 --> 03:40.940
Ancient Vine Immortal,

03:41.220 --> 03:44.089
we would never harm
a single plant in this forest.

03:44.090 --> 03:45.890
We only seek to save a life.

03:45.920 --> 03:48.499
We ask that you return
the Earth Spirit Pearl.

03:48.500 --> 03:51.139
That way, you would not
be acting unjustly.

03:51.140 --> 03:53.570
After all, it belongs to someone else.

03:54.440 --> 03:57.530
Pretty words meant to cover wrongdoing.

03:57.580 --> 04:03.540
The Earth Spirit Pearl is a treasure born
of natural energy, nurtured by mountains and forests.

04:03.560 --> 04:06.960
It has never belonged to any human.

04:07.260 --> 04:10.770
Disgusting humans,
plunderers of the forest.

04:11.260 --> 04:12.860
Then who is the real thief?

04:14.420 --> 04:17.420
You stole the Earth Spirit Pearl
from the flower demon.

04:17.520 --> 04:19.910
Because you stole the Pearl,

04:20.020 --> 04:21.980
Wan Yuzhi's husband
now hangs between life and death.

04:22.020 --> 04:24.659
That is the result of human actions.

04:24.660 --> 04:26.349
For countless generations,

04:26.350 --> 04:29.479
humans have taken freely,
with no sense of reverence.

04:29.480 --> 04:32.379
Such ignorance
invites divine punishment.

04:32.380 --> 04:33.379
You all

04:33.380 --> 04:35.950
will become part of this forest.

04:42.700 --> 04:44.019
Looks like he will not listen at all.

04:44.020 --> 04:46.500
- What do we do?
- Enough talk.

04:54.280 --> 04:56.720
I can sense where the Earth Spirit energy
is the strongest.

04:58.800 --> 05:00.259
It is inside the Vine Old Monster.

05:00.260 --> 05:02.520
I cannot see the exact spot clearly.

05:02.640 --> 05:05.370
Could it be in its belly?

05:07.160 --> 05:09.010
If you do not take the risk,
you gain nothing.

05:11.320 --> 05:12.910
We will know once we go inside.

05:36.600 --> 05:38.200
These cursed vines...

05:41.520 --> 05:44.760
Jing Tian, Zi Xuan, are you all right?

05:46.320 --> 05:47.279
I am fine.

05:47.280 --> 05:49.479
The miasma here is extremely dense.

05:49.480 --> 05:51.059
We must find
the Earth Spirit Pearl quickly

05:51.060 --> 05:52.120
and get out of here.

05:52.220 --> 05:53.600
Otherwise, Tian will be in danger.

06:03.490 --> 06:06.760
Strange. Very strange indeed.

06:07.460 --> 06:08.520
You...

06:08.600 --> 06:09.880
Who are you?

06:10.400 --> 06:16.639
I am the Vine Immortal.

06:16.640 --> 06:17.799
The Vine Immortal?

06:17.800 --> 06:19.919
What is your relationship
with the Vine Old Monster?

06:19.920 --> 06:24.239
The Ancient Vine Spirit
and I share the same roots.

06:24.240 --> 06:26.359
By human terms,

06:26.360 --> 06:29.600
we are brothers.

06:30.280 --> 06:31.439
This place,

06:31.440 --> 06:34.039
though it lies within
the Ancient Vine Spirit's body,

06:34.040 --> 06:36.960
is entirely formed from my roots.

06:37.160 --> 06:39.480
There is no need to be on guard.

06:39.960 --> 06:40.759
Vine Immortal,

06:40.760 --> 06:42.159
since you are brothers,

06:42.160 --> 06:44.040
why are you inside his body?

06:45.730 --> 06:48.760
A very long time ago,

06:48.920 --> 06:54.750
he and I were twin wisteria,
born together in this mountain hollow.

06:54.870 --> 06:57.839
We drew in
the spiritual energy of the land,

06:57.840 --> 06:59.639
and gradually took form.

06:59.640 --> 07:02.280
From us grew an entire vine forest.

07:02.420 --> 07:06.079
One day, we might even
ascend to immortality.

07:06.080 --> 07:07.119
After that,

07:07.120 --> 07:08.699
humans came.

07:08.700 --> 07:10.880
They brought farming and fire.

07:10.920 --> 07:13.269
They settled here
generation after generation.

07:13.270 --> 07:17.719
Inevitably, this left less and less room
for the vine forest to survive.

07:17.720 --> 07:20.439
My younger brother
grew increasingly violent.

07:20.440 --> 07:21.999
Ignoring all my warnings,

07:22.000 --> 07:23.359
he began hunting humans.

07:23.360 --> 07:25.319
He spread poisonous miasma
to kill living beings,

07:25.320 --> 07:26.599
using them as sustenance

07:26.600 --> 07:28.159
to expand the vine forest.

07:28.160 --> 07:30.479
In the end, he fell into monstrosity.

07:30.480 --> 07:32.199
Yet even that did not satisfy him.

07:32.200 --> 07:33.959
When he sensed the Earth Spirit Pearl,

07:33.960 --> 07:35.599
he plotted to steal it,

07:35.600 --> 07:37.899
to grow even more powerful.

07:37.900 --> 07:42.600
In the end, even I was consumed by him.

07:42.880 --> 07:45.680
Now I am riddled with decay,

07:45.960 --> 07:48.679
my life nearly spent.

07:48.680 --> 07:50.440
If this goes on,

07:50.480 --> 07:53.079
he will devour the entire village,

07:53.080 --> 07:55.039
and continue spreading beyond it.

07:55.040 --> 07:57.800
This cannot continue. We must take
the Earth Spirit Pearl away at once.

07:58.120 --> 07:59.559
The Earth Spirit Pearl is not here.

07:59.560 --> 08:02.000
I will open a path.
Let us search elsewhere.

08:02.160 --> 08:03.999
Wait.

08:04.000 --> 08:06.800
Are you planning to cut me down as well?

08:06.810 --> 08:08.280
Then what should we do?

08:08.320 --> 08:11.919
The Earth Spirit Pearl
is embedded near my brother's chest.

08:11.920 --> 08:15.279
It is sealed beneath
many layers of vines.

08:15.280 --> 08:17.680
It can only be broken from the outside.

08:18.320 --> 08:21.400
I can find a way to send you out.

08:21.710 --> 08:25.760
But I beg you to stop my brother,

08:26.770 --> 08:29.860
and grant me my freedom.

08:38.440 --> 08:39.919
Hey, Vine Old Monster.

08:39.920 --> 08:41.199
We meet again.

08:41.200 --> 08:43.339
You actually made it out?

08:43.340 --> 08:46.600
Why not stay inside and serve me?

09:09.300 --> 09:11.460
Vine Old Monster, I am here!

09:34.720 --> 09:37.640
The Vine Old Monster is incredibly strong
and can command the vines,

09:37.920 --> 09:40.049
but it moves slowly
and its sight is limited.

09:40.050 --> 09:42.730
That may be our chance.

10:23.000 --> 10:24.680
Tied up like a giant rice dumpling.

10:40.240 --> 10:42.810
Not a chance!

10:51.680 --> 10:54.780
This is bad. We cannot let it draw in any more
of the Earth Spirit Pearl's power.

11:01.040 --> 11:03.750
You will pay for this!

11:04.520 --> 11:05.200
Xuejian.

11:14.080 --> 11:15.059
Jing Tian!

11:15.060 --> 11:16.360
Now!

11:23.360 --> 11:24.860
Zi Xuan, hurry!

11:41.560 --> 11:42.580
Jing Tian!

12:05.160 --> 12:05.979
Jingjing!

12:05.980 --> 12:06.759
Jingjing!

12:06.760 --> 12:10.480
Look. Do not underestimate me.
I'm a true righteous thief.

12:18.250 --> 12:19.360
Jingjing!

12:22.240 --> 12:23.339
Jingjing.

12:23.340 --> 12:25.080
Jing... Jingjing.

12:28.440 --> 12:31.759
Unfaithful beast. You dare betray me.

12:31.760 --> 12:35.280
None of you will leave this place alive!

13:00.160 --> 13:01.719
Between heaven and earth,

13:01.720 --> 13:05.080
there exist five natural forces,
wind, thunder, water, fire, and earth.

13:05.160 --> 13:06.660
They counter and reinforce one another.

13:17.540 --> 13:19.300
The Ancient Vine Spirit
holds the Earth Spirit Pearl.

13:19.300 --> 13:20.879
Earth restrains wind.
Wind restrains thunder.

13:20.880 --> 13:22.599
Thunder restrains water.
Water restrains fire.

13:22.600 --> 13:24.320
Fire restrains earth.

13:37.240 --> 13:40.259
Blazing Skyfire!

13:40.260 --> 13:41.420
(Blazing Skyfire)

14:18.860 --> 14:20.070
Jingjing.

14:21.970 --> 14:24.760
Did I make up for what I did wrong?

14:24.850 --> 14:27.410
Yes. You did.

14:30.520 --> 14:33.319
At least now, I did not shame my master.

14:33.320 --> 14:37.199
Do I count as a righteous thief now?

14:37.200 --> 14:39.559
Yes. Of course you do.

14:39.560 --> 14:41.840
You are the greatest
righteous thief of all.

14:43.680 --> 14:46.680
No. My master is.

14:47.140 --> 14:51.320
My master's ultimate skill
must not be lost through me.

14:52.760 --> 14:57.119
Thank you for avenging me.
I do not have much time left.

14:57.120 --> 15:00.360
I will pass this technique on to you.

15:04.160 --> 15:07.240
The Flying Dragon Cloud-Stealing Hand
can stop time.

15:07.520 --> 15:10.319
Everyone's movements will slow down.

15:10.320 --> 15:13.789
Even the important items
they carry will float up.

15:13.790 --> 15:16.450
That is when you take what you want.

15:17.160 --> 15:19.719
This is Jingjing's secret technique.

15:19.720 --> 15:21.400
Did you see it clearly?

15:21.600 --> 15:23.400
Yes. I did.

15:24.400 --> 15:29.400
From now on, you are the sole inheritor
of the Flying Dragon Cloud-Stealing Hand.

15:31.840 --> 15:37.160
Please return everything I stole
from the village to the villagers.

15:38.440 --> 15:39.560
Jingjing!

15:41.040 --> 15:46.580
All things in heaven and earth move
through the endless cycle of life and death.

15:48.480 --> 15:50.560
His journey

15:51.100 --> 15:53.080
has come to its end.

16:27.480 --> 16:28.239
Yu...

16:28.240 --> 16:29.240
Yuzhi...

16:29.640 --> 16:32.160
Dear, you are awake.

16:33.640 --> 16:35.200
Get some rest first.

16:37.920 --> 16:42.000
Thank you all for your great kindness.
I have no way to repay you.

16:46.240 --> 16:48.920
You have already
obtained the Earth Spirit Pearl.

16:49.800 --> 16:53.960
I will also give you my thousand years
of cultivation. I will keep my word.

16:54.080 --> 16:55.440
There is no need.

16:56.240 --> 16:58.560
You only need to give her some guidance.

17:05.760 --> 17:09.000
- The flowers have bloomed. They are beautiful.
- Yes.

17:09.770 --> 17:11.789
Is this the Ru ware flower vase I lost?

17:11.790 --> 17:13.420
- My hairpin is here too.
- And my thumb ring.

17:13.420 --> 17:15.440
Now Jingjing can finally rest easy.

17:28.180 --> 17:30.250
Changqing, you are finally back.

17:30.570 --> 17:32.840
Master is inside the pavilion.
Please go in quickly.

17:33.400 --> 17:34.160
Mm.

18:06.010 --> 18:07.340
(This is strange.)

18:07.510 --> 18:10.420
(Master has never used
such strong sandalwood incense before.)

18:22.160 --> 18:24.610
Master, I pay my respects.

18:25.400 --> 18:27.479
So you have returned.

18:27.480 --> 18:30.439
Did you bring back the famed sword?

18:30.440 --> 18:33.560
I am ashamed to say I failed
to find the famed sword for you.

18:33.670 --> 18:35.559
Master, how are your injuries?

18:35.560 --> 18:40.810
No famed sword, and you still dare
disturb my cultivation. Leave at once.

18:43.760 --> 18:45.400
Please take good care
of yourself, Master.

18:48.100 --> 18:50.160
(Why has Master changed so much?)

18:50.400 --> 18:52.160
(Is it because of his injuries?)

18:52.200 --> 18:55.960
(It seems he does not
even remember casting me out.)

18:56.160 --> 18:59.200
(And inside this hall,
besides Master's presence,)

18:59.290 --> 19:01.319
(why do I sense a faint,
sinister presence,)

19:01.320 --> 19:03.010
(masked by the incense?)

19:07.830 --> 19:09.109
Unite sword and qi,

19:09.110 --> 19:10.590
ride the sword and soar.

19:10.830 --> 19:11.750
Rise!

19:13.270 --> 19:14.510
It worked!

19:15.510 --> 19:16.670
Jingjing!

19:37.870 --> 19:41.149
♪War flames rise,
the mountains and rivers tremble♪

19:41.150 --> 19:44.469
♪Reincarnation begins,
cause and effect fall into chaos♪

19:44.470 --> 19:48.149
♪The night grows thick, dark as ink♪

19:48.150 --> 19:51.349
♪The wheel of fate starts
to turn backward♪

19:51.350 --> 19:54.509
♪Crimson palace walls,
stained with blood and tears♪

19:54.510 --> 19:58.189
♪Vows scatter with the wind,
fading into the clouds♪

19:58.190 --> 20:01.909
♪Moonlight cannot pierce this darkness♪

20:01.910 --> 20:08.389
♪Who cries out in loneliness
from the abyss♪

20:08.390 --> 20:11.869
♪The net of destiny tightens ever more♪

20:11.870 --> 20:15.349
♪The lock of karma
binds a lifetime unbroken♪

20:15.350 --> 20:18.749
♪Love and hate entwined beyond escape♪

20:18.750 --> 20:22.149
♪Not awaken in a world of chaos♪

20:22.150 --> 20:25.509
♪Stars shatter, heaven and earth mourn♪

20:25.510 --> 20:29.029
♪Snow fills Shu Mountain,
only ruins remain♪

20:29.030 --> 20:32.389
♪Five elements in balance,
six realms side by side♪

20:32.390 --> 20:35.709
♪All for the sake of the living♪

20:35.710 --> 20:40.510
♪Stepping onto a path of no return♪

20:56.040 --> 20:59.840
(Next episode preview)
I never thought I would set foot in Shu Mountain.

21:00.240 --> 21:03.000
This truly is a realm
like heaven on earth.

21:04.520 --> 21:05.600
That sword...

21:06.000 --> 21:07.240
Let me take a look.

21:09.760 --> 21:10.919
Careful! Something is wrong with Changqing.

21:10.920 --> 21:12.719
That sword belongs to Shu Mountain.

21:12.720 --> 21:14.090
Return it at once.

21:14.280 --> 21:16.280
Changqing, forgive me.

21:25.600 --> 21:28.200
Changqing, look at me.
